== lattice-site counts, using the MEASURED laws of r45_lattice_count/r45_checks2 (T <= 108 lattice units)
   (A) aligned crystal (observer at rest, diamond): Var = F rho V, F = 0.60 (Z4), 7.76 (L7)  -> dLambda = Sorkin * F^-1/2
       F=0.60: dLambda/dLambda_Sorkin = 1.291
       F=7.76: dLambda/dLambda_Sorkin = 0.359
   (B) LRL, Haar-ball-averaged: Var ~ c T^2.2, c T^2 with c ~ 0.5-0.9 (a=1, covolume sqrt7) at T<=108.
       EXTRAPOLATION ONLY (TESTS.md:8: no verdict rests on it): if Var = 0.9 (T/a)^2 held at T = c t0, a = lbar:
       dLambda = 3.770e+07 m^-2 = 3.458e+59 Lambda_obs; epoch scaling dLambda ~ 1/T ~ H, not H^2
   (C) misaligned crystal: aligned time-row term suppressed by sinc^2(M d T/2), M = 2 pi/s, d = sinh(eta)
       Sun vs CMB d = 1.23e-03; M d T/2 at T = c t0, s = lbar: 6.242e+57  -> suppression ~ 2.6e-116
